### Vytvor workera
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Peter Horák", "department": "IT"}

### Vytvor druhého workera (rovnaké oddelenie - kvôli reassignu nižšie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Jana Malá", "department": "IT"}

### Vytvor task priradený prvému workerovi
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Naprogramovať API", "status": "TODO", "priority": "HIGH", "dueDate": "2027-01-01T10:00:00", "department": "IT", "workerId": 1}

### Zmeň task na druhého workera (musí byť v rovnakom oddelení ako task)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Naprogramovať API", "status": "TODO", "priority": "HIGH", "dueDate": "2027-01-01T10:00:00", "department": "IT", "workerId": 2}

### Over zmenu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
